uas in vero circulo\n[[1371.17]] experientia haud dubie esset confirmatura. </p>\n","number":"259.","title":"Quid sit Idea","date":"[Herbst 1677 (?)]"}
      </script>

      <!-- Detailed scholarly view with line numbers -->
      <div id="scholarly-view" class="text-view">
